eam/apps/2026500/extras/db49ab8003dd4146a1118ed56eb093ad.mp4?t=1681581003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>After getting through the darkness together, they fall in love and decide to advance and retreat together. You need to control the boy and the girl to move in the same direction at the same time, you need to make sure that they can safely cross the obstacle without getting hurt, and finally meet each other.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026500/extras/8fb73d451b63194455d08c55063285d4.poster.avif?t=1681581003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026500/extras/8fb73d451b63194455d08c55063285d4.webm?t=1681581003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026500/extras/8fb73d451b63194455d08c55063285d4.mp4?t=1681581003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Sometimes they have different opinions. You still control both the boy and the girl at the same time, but they will move in opposite directions and you need to make sure they still meet eventually.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026500/extras/54d20133021ee756822aeb3d563dba25.poster.avif?t=1681581003\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2026500/extras/54d20133021ee756822aeb3d563dba25.mp4?t=1681581003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>More scenarios and challenges are waiting for you in the game.",
